The pointKinetics neutronics model currently computes average perturbed values for feedback fields (T fuel, cladding, etc.) by weighting those over oneGroupFlux. This is not technically correct as they should be weighted also via the adjoint flux.This will be addressed in future updates, but given that the adjoint flux is equal to the flux if dealing with only one energy group, this is deemed fine for now.
